# Python bytecode. Interpreter- and machine-specific build output that churns
# on every edit and that nothing reads from the repository (beid#399).
# The two .pyc files that used to be tracked under scripts/tests/__pycache__
# were untracked here. They mattered because #423 made PR CI run
# `python3 -m unittest discover -s scripts/tests`, so running the documented
# command dirties the working tree for anyone who follows it.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
